    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosef tenebo ilalashera lenyena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebik Yakobo teina kop apa naidurraka papaai lenyena te ina kop e Kanaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena enkatini o lmarei le Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore aa oloo larin tomon oopishana Yosef, neirritita apa intare tenebo ilalashera lenyena; ore apa aa enkayioni ninye netii apa tenebo ilayiok le Bilha o Silpa nena kituaak e Papaai lenye, neyaki Yosef papaai lenye ilomon torrok ooipirta ilalashera lenyena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyor apa Israel Yosef oleng aitalang inkera enyena pooki, amu etoikioki ninye etaa kitok oleng, neitobiraki ninye olkila oodo loo inkaik adoru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore peyie edol ilalashera lenyena aajo kenyor menye ninye aitalang ilalashera lenyena pooki, neibayu ninche ninye oleng, neaku meyieu neirorie ninye te supatisho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netum Yosef enkidetidet, ore peyie eliki ilalashera lenyena neibayu ninche ninye oleng'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninye ninche, “Entoning ena kidetidet naidetidetua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, kigira iyiook aaen irridat le enkano tiatua enkurma naa ng'ura, ore orridati lai etudumunye aitashe, aitoriori naa ng'ura, ore irridat linyi pooki eetuo pooki aiturrurrokino aaman ninye, neirrugokino pooki orridati lai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilalashera lenyena ninye, “Kesipa iyaku oloitore iyiook? Arashu iyaku oloota enkitoo te iyiook pooki?” Neaku eibaitie ninche ninye oleng too nkidetidetat enyena o too rorei lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake atum ae kidetidet, neliki ilalashera lenyena nejo, “Ng'ura anyaaka aidetidet ae kidetidet; naa ng'ura, ore enkolong o lapa o lakir tomon oobo neaku kaapuonu aairrugokino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake peyie eliki menye neliki sii ilalashera eisikong'a menye nejoki ninye, “Kainyoo doi ena kidetidet nindetidetu? Metaa kaalotu nanu tenebo yieyioo lino o lalashera linono aairrugo aabaiki enkop te dukuya iyie?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Netum ilalashera lenyena olom te nkaraki ninye, kake etushuma menye ina kiroroto to ltau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etimiraki Yosef neyai Misiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedumunye ilalashera lenyena aapuo airrita intare e menye te mbata e Shekem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Israel Yosef, “Aimegira ilalashera linono aairrita intare te Shekem? Wou maairriwai enetii ninche.” Nejoki Yosef ninye, “Nele nanu.” Ina peyie ejoki ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Shomo tena kata taleenoi tenaa keserian ilalashera linono, o ntare, nikintoki ayaki olomoni.” Neaku eirriwayie ninye to erata le Hebron, nelo Shekem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinepu oltung'ani ninye egira alilita too nkong'at; neikilikuan ilo tung'ani ninye ajoki, “Ainyoo doi ing'oru?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Agira aing'oru ilalashera laainei, tolikioki sii ake aatasayia, kaji doi etii aairritayie intare.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ilo tung'ani, “Eshomo aaidurraki dikae, amu atoning'o ninche ejo, ‘Maape Dotan.’ ” Metaa eshomo Yosef asujaa ilalashera lenyena, netum ninche te Dotan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nedolu ninche ninye elakua ore eton eitu elotu anyikaki ninche, neinos ninche enkiguana peyie ear ninye metua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejokino maate, “Nelido oloshi aidetidetani olotu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wootu taata, emataar ninye metua nikinang'aki ninye engumoto nabo te kuna, nikipuo aajo eng'ues entim ninye nainosa ninye, nikianyu aadol enaaku inkidetidetat enyena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore peyie ening Ruben ina, neitajeu ninye too nkaik enye nejoki, “Mikiar ninye metua.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Ruben ninche, “Emimbukoo osarge; entanang'aki ninye atua ena gumoto tene tiong'ota, kake eminteleiki ninye enkaina aar metua,” peyie etum aitajeu ninye aitung'ai enkaina enye, arrinyoki ninye papaai lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa ore peyie elotu Yosef enetii ilalashera lenyena, neng'as aaoru ninye olkila lenye, ilo kila oodo oota inkaik adoru oishopito; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neya ninye aanang'aki eng'umoto, ore ina gumoto nemetii toki, metii enkare atua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netoni ninche te nkop aanya endaa, nejo mataraposhu nkonyek enye nedol encholiek oolamirak le Ishmael epuonu aaing'uaa Gilead, ereuta intamesin enye, enapita neeta intokitin naaji ubani, o Seu, o emanoo etii enkoitoi edoyio aapuo Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ina peyie ejoki Yuda ilalashera lenyena, “Ainyoo taa doi kitum tinikiar olalashe lang metua, nikituroo osarge lenye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wootu, ematimir ninye aamiraki kulo tungana le Ishmael, nimikincho inkaik ang ebaiki ninye, amu olalashe lang ninye, olo sarge lang.” Nenyorraa ilalashera ina natejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Iat 7.9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore peyie epuonu ilbiasharani le Midian aaim ine: neyietu Yosef aaitayu te ng'umoto, nemiraki ninye lelo tungana le Ishmael te shekeli tikitam e nkosholai; neya ninche Yosef Misiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee eshukunye Ruben enaduoo gumoto nedol ajo meekure etii ine, nepolos inkilani enyena tosina sapuk, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nerrinyo enetii ilalashera lenyena nejoki: “Metii enkayioni ine kaji taata alo nanu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neya olkila le Yosef, neyieng enkine, neitadoiki ilo kila osarge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neirriwaa ilo kila adoru inkaik meyakini menye, nejo, “Nele olkila likinotito, ng'ura sii iyie tujurru tenaa kolkila lo layioni lino anaa aimeninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyiolou nabo kata ninye, nejo, “Olkila lo layioni lai; einosa eng'ues entim ninye; maing'ash tukul ajo etumuta Yosef ing'uesi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepolos Yakobo inkilani enyena to sina nerreten olkuniyia te mpolos enye. Neishiraki olayioni lenye inkolong'i kumok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo ilayiok pooki lenyena tenebo intoyie enyena pooki aaibung ninye aitagol; kake etanya ninye tukul eitagoli, nejo, “A-a ekalo abori enemeneng'a enetii olayioni lai, aishirita.” Metaa eishiraka menye ninye oleng. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 37:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ina rishata eidipa Ilmidian aatimir ninye te Misiri aamiraki Potifa, obo loo laitoriak le Farao, aa ninye olkitok loo larripok le wueji netii Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.37.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
